  "schema:description": "Purpose: Measurement of water column Secchi depth in non-wadeable streams and lakes\n\nProject: National Ecological Research Network (NEON)\n\nProject abstract: The National Ecological Observatory Network is a project sponsored by the National Science Foundation.\n\nNEON's mission is to design, implement, and operate continental-scale research infrastructure to open new horizons in ecological science and education, and to enable ecological analyses and forecasts for the benefit of society.\n\nStudy area: \"2011 Science Strategy: Enabling Continental-Scale Ecological Forecasting\" National Ecological Observatory Network (NEON) 1685 38th Street, Suite 100 Boulder CO 80301 USA 720-746-4844 http://www.neonscience.org 2011 english Copyright 2011 NEON, Inc. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED http://www.neonscience.org/sites/default/files/basic-page-files/NEON_Strategy_2011u2_0.pdf National Ecological Observatory Network (NEON) 1685 38th Street, Suite 100 Boulder CO 80301 USA 720-746-4844 http://www.neonscience.org 56\n\nStudy design: neon_2011_sciencedesign",
